#. 希望ヶ峰学園の<CLT 3>学園長<CLT>…だったはずだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It could only have been...the <CLT 3>headmaster<CLT> of Hope's\n"
"Peak Academy."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 学園長は、希望ヶ峰学園をシェルター化する事で、
#. ボクらを守ろうとしたんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He wanted to turn the school into a shelter to try and\n"
"protect us."
msgstr ""

#. 外で起きている…絶望的事件から…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"To protect us...from the despair and tragedy taking\n"
"place outside."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、学園長は、
#. ボクらにあんな約束をさせてたんだ…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's why he asked us to make that promise..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園で一生を過ごすかもしれない…なんて…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"To say that we were willing to live in this school\n"
"forever."
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園の学園長は、
#. きっと、こんな風に考えていたのでしょう。
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "We believe he had something like that in mind, yes."
msgstr ""

#. あなた達のような次世代の希望さえ生き残れば、
#. 世界は、何度でもやり直せると…
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you, the collective hope of a new generation, could\n"
"survive, maybe the world could have a fresh start."
msgstr ""

#. そうです…学園長はあなた達に、
#. そんな希望を託していたんですよ…
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Yeah...the headmaster put that much faith in you."
msgstr ""

#. ボクら自身も…それを知ってたからこそ…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And because we had that same hope..."
msgstr ""

#. 同意…してたんだな…
#. <CLT 3>“ここでの一生の学園生活”<CLT>に…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's why we all agreed...to <CLT 3>live here forever<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、そのシェルター化は
#. 学園長の最大の誤算でもあったんだよ。
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But creating the shelter was also his single biggest\n"
"mistake."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…笑っちゃうよね。
#. 学園長のクセに知らなかったんだよ。
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... It's laughable, really. He was the\n"
"headmaster, but he had nooo idea."
msgstr ""

#. ボクら<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>が、
#. すでに学園の中に存在してる事にね！
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"He had no idea that we, the <CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>, had\n"
"already made our way into the school."
msgstr ""

#. そして、オマエラを守るはずだったシェルター化は…
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So what was supposed to be a shelter to keep you\n"
"safe..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラを絶望から逃さない為の、
#. <CLT 3>“檻”<CLT>になってしまったんだ。
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"...became a <CLT 3>cage<CLT> that made it impossible for you to\n"
"escape despair."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ボクとしては、
#. 手間が省けて、大助かりだったけどね！
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. I have to say, it really helped me out a lot!\n"
"It saved me a ton of time."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、ここの窓や出入り口を封鎖したのは、
#. 他でもない、あなた方自身だったのですよ。
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"By the way, it was you yourselves who blocked off the\n"
"windows, the doors, all the exits."
msgstr ""

#. 学園長先導の元、
#. みんなでトンチンカンやったのです。
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Under the headmaster's direction, you all went about\n"
"your work like obedient little sheep."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、俺らは…
#. 自分達の手で…自分達を閉じ込めたんか…？
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You mean...we trapped ourselves in here?"
msgstr ""

#. そんで、それを忘れて、勝手に騒いでたんだよ！
#. 閉じ込められたーってなぁ！！
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And then you forgot all about it, and started bitching\n"
"about how you were trapped in here!"
msgstr ""

#. そして、そのシェルター化が完了した後は、
#. ボクとむくろの出番…
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Once you'd finished building your little shelter, it\n"
"was time for me and Mukuro to get to work."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…コロシアイ学園生活の始まりって訳だよ…
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "And thus began the killing game!"
msgstr ""

#. 私とむくろ姉さんは…この時の為に…
#. ２年も前から…ここに乗り込んでいたんです…
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Me and Mukuro had come here, spending the last two\n"
"years waiting for that moment..."
msgstr ""

#. すべては、この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>を、
#. 人類絶望化計画のクライマックスにする為に！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That moment where <CLT 3>you all began killing each other<CLT>\n"
"served as the climax of our global despair plan!"
msgstr ""

#. そして、あなた方だけが絶望的事件を生き残ったのも、
#. このクライマックスに参加してもらう為だったのです。
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And the only reason you survived The Tragedy was so\n"
"that you could be part of it..."
msgstr ""

#. この殺し合いをさせられる為に…
#. 私達は生かされた…って事？
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You only let us live...so we could go around killing\n"
"each other. Is that what you're saying?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…そこまでして…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why...? Why would you do that?"
msgstr ""

#. これが、ただのコロシアイじゃないから。
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Because this was so much more than a simple high\n"
"school death match..."
msgstr ""

#. これは言わば、残党狩り…
#. 残ったすべての希望を終わらせる為のコロシアイなの。
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Rather, it was a method to hunt down and destroy every\n"
"last remaining speck of hope in the world."
msgstr ""

#. どういう…意味だよ…？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#. 外には、まだ少しだけ残ってるみたいなんだよね。
#. 希望を捨て切れない未練がましい連中がさ…
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well, it would seem that there's a little bit left out\n"
"there, a few souls unwilling to give up hope..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、そんな連中に見せ付けてやろうと思ってさ…
#. その為にアタシは…
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "So I thought I should show them. Which is why I..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…何をしたんだと思う？
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... Well, why don't you tell me?"
msgstr ""
